go 1.26

// Go workspace spanning every in-repo Go module. A change in a shared Go
// package is picked up on the next build with no `replace` directives.
//
// Modules are added here as they are created/ported (plan.md §10). The root
// Makefile discovers workspace modules dynamically, so adding a `use` line is
// the only edit needed to adopt a new Go module.
use ./packages/contracts/example-server
